# Evidence from live runs travels through LFS. These are model transcripts and the
# command histories that rebuild a game — they are read, replayed and diffed rarely,
# and a session log runs to megabytes of HTTP chatter. story.md is deliberately not
# here: it is the readable one, and it should render on GitHub.
runs/**/session.log filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
runs/**/transcript.txt filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
runs/**/chronicle.json filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
runs/**/replay.json filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
